# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Proxy diagnostics
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------

# This component's own health, not mirrored from the remote dictionary.
# Without it, a link dropping or garbling packets looks the same as a quiet one.

@ Packets decoded into events or telemetry
